<title>USA: INSIGHT-Dlr/mark locks in on 1.8075 objective.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT-Dlr/mark locks in on 1.8075 objective.</headline>
<text>
<p>DLR* *S/TERM RANGE  *SUPPORT *RESTNCE *RSI-14 *MA-8   *MA-13</p>
<p>DEM* *1.7850/1.8195 *1.7940  *1.8075  *75 pct *1.7697 *1.7611</p>
<p>YEN* *113.50/117.00 *114.55  *116.05  *56 pct *113.70 *113.97</p>
<p>-----------VIEWS FROM THE MARKET---------July 15-------------</p>
<p>*Dlr/mark bullish, takes out 1.8025, the target after six-week</p>
<p>rising channel breach at 1.7960. Next objective at 1.8075/95.</p>
<p>*Dlr/Swiss eyes 1.4830 target for retest of 1.4922, '97 high.</p>
<p>*Dlr/yen toppish below 116.00. Key resistance at 116.35 on way</p>
<p>to 117.00, 38-pct retrace of 127.46-110.62, '97 high-low move.</p>
<p>*Sterling/mark steady above 3.0025 key support, retrace level.</p>
<p>*Mark/yen rebounds. Breach of 65.55 needed to confirm recovery</p>
</text>
